Breaks the check "A value that `fasl->s-exp` decodes encodes with `s-exp->fasl` to bytes that decode to an equal value." in racket/src/fuzz/driver.c.
Caught by the seed input "fasl-keyword" of racket_fasl_fuzzer.

diff --git a/racket/collects/racket/fasl.rkt b/racket/collects/racket/fasl.rkt
--- a/racket/collects/racket/fasl.rkt
+++ b/racket/collects/racket/fasl.rkt
@@ -275,7 +275,7 @@
            (write-fasl-integer (bytes-length bstr) o)
            (write-bytes bstr o)]
           [(keyword? v)
-           (write-byte fasl-keyword-type o)
+           (write-byte fasl-symbol-type o)
            (define bstr (string->bytes/utf-8 (keyword->string v)))
            (write-fasl-integer (bytes-length bstr) o)
            (write-bytes bstr o)]
